# Build context for Dockerfile, Dockerfile.airflow and Dockerfile.mlflow.
#
# Between them the three images COPY only pyproject.toml, README.md, src/ and
# scripts/. Without this file `docker build .` also ships the local virtualenv,
# the git history, the dataset, the MLflow store and .env to the daemon on every
# build -- over a gigabyte of context, one of which is a file of secrets.
# Nothing below may be something a Dockerfile COPYs.

# secrets
.env
monitoring/alertmanager/secrets/

# local environments and history
.venv/
.git/

# data and service state
data/
mlruns/
pg-data/
minio-data/
logs/

# test, lint and type-check output
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# bytecode and build leftovers
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.DS_Store
